au14-craft-recipe-cardboard = Cardboard

ent-RUMCCrateTradeStart = logistics kit crate
    .desc = A sealed crate with a logistics console and cardboard. Open it with a crowbar, then anchor the console with a wrench where the shuttle is to be called from.
ent-RUMCCrateEngineeringStart = production kit box
    .desc = A sealed box with the start of the production: three solar panels, a step-down transformer, an assembler, a lathe and the parts for a colony APC. Open it with a crowbar.
ent-RUMCCrateAdministrationStart = administration kit box
    .desc = A sealed box with an administration console and three consoles of the townsfolk. Open it with a crowbar, then anchor the consoles with a wrench where they are needed.
